# HMG-API core: Android Auto library, sensor types 22-26 and raw messages (ProjectionHooks.sendRaw).
# For the stock build dbfe7bd2e36152a50f97fed612cf6326; its verify windows mismatch on any other build.
# Not made from the library here: the last three windows are egmp-aa-ev's ev-sensor-dbfe7bd2 (its
# tool, on the stock library; same bytes written). The first window's stock bytes are 48ee793a's at
# 0x144eba (both of egmp's hashes match them), so its hash with cmp r0,#25 is computed from those.
# args: --sites 0x144e82,0xb14e6,0xb18ac --queue 0xaf50a --id aa-raw-dbfe7bd2
